Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Legends of Sports Heroes: Dunk for Victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.80,Title,,0,0,0,,The Mysterious Ace
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:36.96,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued…
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.56,0:00:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In the previous episode, we mentioned that Team Goats faced the formidable Team Rats in their first game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Goats initially fell behind because they were too nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, Team Goats showed their true strength in the second half and tied the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, there were only ten seconds left in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.32,0:00:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The last 10 seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We won’t let you get past us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.24,0:00:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.84,0:00:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Thunder Rats is keeping a close eye on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.60,0:01:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We deliberately left your shooting guard unguarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.04,0:01:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We did that so we could intercept the pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.84,0:01:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How did Team Rats’ center end up over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.96,0:01:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Team Thunder Rats anticipated that the ball would be passed to Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.84,0:01:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, they’re about to steal the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.03,0:01:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.44,0:01:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi actually used his small frame
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.68,0:01:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,to block Team Thunder Rats’ center!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.40,0:01:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What? The pass wasn’t for Paddi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.64,0:01:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like Coach expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tibbie, you’re going to take the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.88,0:01:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? But I’m not good at shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s exactly why they’ll overlook you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.08,0:02:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They’ll definitely assume we’ll pass the ball to Paddi, our shooting guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just imagine the small square on the backboard is
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.08,0:02:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the person you’re passing to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders wins—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.32,0:02:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.36,0:02:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.64,0:02:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well played!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.32,0:02:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys played amazingly!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.40,0:02:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t believe we lost. You guys are so weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.28,0:02:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re not weak at all; you’re underestimating us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.00,0:02:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Basketball is a five-player sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as the five of us stick together, anything is possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I look forward to playing against you guys again next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.00,0:03:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to train right after the game. Can’t we take a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.68,0:03:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.84,0:03:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Champ and Trump? What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you upset about losing and here to look for trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.28,0:03:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re the scrimmage partners I invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.08,0:03:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You lack practical experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.24,0:03:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s why I specifically invited them to scrimmage with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.76,0:03:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.88,0:03:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let’s start with some basic training.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.76,0:03:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Run 20 laps.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.80,0:03:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s really surprising that Champ and Trump are willing to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.28,0:03:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If they can win the championship,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,then there’s no shame in losing to the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.52,0:03:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Can they really win the championship?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.16,0:03:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have many more games to play, so don’t let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.88,0:03:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:04:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Two months later
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.40,0:04:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,After two months of games,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.72,0:04:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone has improved as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But we mustn’t get complacent. We still need to keep working on our fundamentals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.44,0:04:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.72,0:04:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I still need to learn how to dunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.68,0:04:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I’ll be the coolest player on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.68,0:04:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected, my skills aren’t good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.72,0:04:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And they didn’t want to teach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Champ!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.04,0:04:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to learn how to dunk. Can you teach me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.40,0:04:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Dunking? Of course—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.16,0:04:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.48,0:04:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.16,0:05:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Master the basics first. Go practice your dribbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.36,0:05:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, I want to learn how to dunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.44,0:05:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you teach me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.44,0:05:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Dunking? Of course—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.72,0:05:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.96,0:05:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Build a solid foundation first, one step at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.08,0:05:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to learn to walk before you can run, or you’ll easily fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.44,0:05:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to find someone who will teach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.92,0:05:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve finished all the chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.40,0:05:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I go on the court now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead. Clean the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s just cleaning, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.48,0:05:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Wolffy, am the king of cleaning! Just watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.96,0:05:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I’ve got the whole court to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.64,0:06:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I… I’ll clean it up right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.12,0:06:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain is really amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.84,0:06:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How come there are only a few of you left?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, all the other second-string players have applied to leave the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.04,0:06:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And No. 99’s relatives… I wonder where they’ve gone to slack off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.48,0:07:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Those useless wolves! You guys, get over here and practice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.64,0:07:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.76,0:07:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No. 99, give us the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.52,0:07:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.96,0:07:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.40,0:07:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, the one cleaning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come practice with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you calling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.28,0:07:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone else here cleaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I’m coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.76,0:07:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, we can take a break. I’m going to get something good to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.80,0:07:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All you want to do is eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.40,0:07:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:08:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,—Lion Jay!　—Lion Jay, Lion Jay, invincible handsome Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.76,0:08:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up is—Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.80,0:08:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}Lion Jay is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.62,0:08:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,870)}Isn’t he exactly that mysterious ace?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So his name is Lion Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.44,0:08:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello fan, please go over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.20,0:08:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.56,0:08:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.28,0:08:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,With a Quick Dry towel, you won’t have to worry about all that sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.89,0:08:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Buy, buy, buy! Handsome, handsome, handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.68,0:08:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you all for coming to our event.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.92,0:08:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Lion Jay has a special gift for his fans!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.76,0:08:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever catches the Quick Dry towel thrown by Lion Jay
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:09:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,can come up on stage and take a photo with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.32,0:09:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you guys want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.78,0:09:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We want!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.49,0:09:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.64,0:09:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.48,0:09:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.36,0:09:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,—Don’t steal mine!　—Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.40,0:09:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay, do you still remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Sparky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.93,0:09:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares what your name is? Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.56,0:09:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us our towel back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, have we met before?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.60,0:09:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That night at 11 pm, you came to the streetball court to practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.44,0:09:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You even showed me your amazing dunking skills!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.80,0:09:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re just talking nonsense. Why are you pretending to know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay would never practice basketball late at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.20,0:09:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, our Lion Jay would never stay up all night practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.28,0:09:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, this fan,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.80,0:09:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you must have been mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay is a health ambassador who goes to bed early and gets up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s no way he’d practice late at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.88,0:10:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly! You fake fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.52,0:10:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.84,0:10:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, everyone, remember to go to bed early and get up early!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.12,0:10:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, you can be as healthy as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.52,0:10:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! Lion Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.92,0:10:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s clearly him. Why won’t he admit it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay is so handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.56,0:10:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys like Lion Jay too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.20,0:10:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.88,0:10:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re finally starting to grow up and learn to study your opponents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.40,0:10:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Lion Heart is our opponent in the next game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.68,0:10:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.96,0:10:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Lion Jay is so amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn’t that mean our chance of winning is only 1%?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:10:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.84,0:11:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,However, that 1% chance belongs to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.16,0:11:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Our chance of winning is 99%.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.20,0:11:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.96,0:11:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Lion Heart is very strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.12,0:11:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but they have a fatal weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.60,0:11:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, their coach is also Lion Jay’s agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.12,0:11:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn’t care about winning or losing; he only cares about Lion Jay’s image.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.44,0:11:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All he wants to do is make Lion Jay a popular idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.28,0:11:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So that’s how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish someone could teach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.76,0:11:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Lion Jay will come here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.40,0:11:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Lion Jay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.24,0:12:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, you weren’t mistaken about me yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.96,0:12:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,However, my agent was nearby,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.04,0:12:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,so I couldn’t admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.88,0:12:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.92,0:12:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m an idol, so a lot of things are just out of my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.32,0:12:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems Coach was telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.36,0:12:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you sneak out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.48,0:12:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,To practice. My agent keeps me way too busy with work,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,so I had no choice but to sneak out at night to practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.88,0:12:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So that’s how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.12,0:12:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Lion Jay,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I still want to learn how to dunk from you.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
